    "Id": "chassisdef_vindicator_VND-1P",
    "Name": "Vindicator",
    "Details": "The 1P retains the left-torso LRM-5 and head-mounted medium laser, dropping the small laser and PPC for a large laser in the right arm and a medium hatchet in the left.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Rugged</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.01</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Right Lower</color>",
